# Pinned Swift Embedded WebAssembly SDK for the `runner-wasm-vendor` CI job.
#
# The job installs Swift 6.4.0 via swiftly, then:
#   swift sdk install "$url" --checksum "$checksum"
# and builds with `--swift-sdk swift-6.4.0-RELEASE_wasm-embedded`
# (see scripts/build-runner-wasm.sh).
#
# This is the official swift.org WebAssembly SDK bundle for the 6.4.0 release.
# Installing this ONE bundle provides BOTH SDK identifiers:
#   * swift-6.4.0-RELEASE_wasm           (full Swift)
#   * swift-6.4.0-RELEASE_wasm-embedded  (Embedded Swift — what we build with)
# URL + checksum are the values published at
# https://www.swift.org/documentation/articles/wasm-getting-started.html
# Update both when bumping the Swift toolchain (must stay matched to the swiftly
# version pinned in .github/workflows/runner-wasm-vendor.yml).
url=https://download.swift.org/swift-6.4.0-release/wasm-sdk/swift-6.4.0-RELEASE/swift-6.4.0-RELEASE_wasm.artifactbundle.tar.gz
checksum=f07b7be3c586d92d7a07051fc6d303b87ebea67eadc40640ba59d5a8b79aa86d
